<title>POLAND: NBP SELLS PLN 400 MLN OF 273-DAY BILLS, YIELD UP.</title>
<headline>NBP SELLS PLN 400 MLN OF 273-DAY BILLS, YIELD UP.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland sold all 400 million zlotys of its 273-day NBP-bills on offer after banks bid for 446 million zlotys of the paper, the bank said.</p>
<p>The average yield rose 0.02 point to 19.97 percent.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
</text>
